Introduction
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯
Fast doc..
Car is a little game. You should've tried it before.

The Plot
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯
When I played this game before it was only three cars,
but it's to easy to win then, now we got four..
First you get $300, then you bet on one of four cars.
Then you win, or loose money, after watching the race.

Installation
¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯
You should be familiar with DayDream's door-installation procedure,
but here it is..

Copy Car to your Doors: directory.
Copy CarBanner.GFX and CarBanner.TXT to your display/iso dir
Copy CarLogo.GFX/.TXT to your display/iso dir
Copy hiscore.car to DayDream:configs/
Install this door in your DayDream.cfg config:

DOOR_COMMAND.. CAR
DOOR_TYPE..... 1
DOOR_SECURITY. 5
DOOR_EXECUTE.. Daydream:Doors/Car %N

Now compile config and play!!

